## Status Vocabulary

| Status | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `drafting` | Still clarifying scope; formal artifacts are not ready. |
| `generated` | MVP artifacts have been generated, but final user completion is not confirmed. |
| `needs_revision` | User feedback or review findings require artifact updates. |
| `completed` | User explicitly confirmed MVP definition is finished. |
| `blocked` | Skill cannot continue until a missing decision or input is resolved. |

