## Rules

- Every MVP scope, page, copy, artifact, Figma Prompt, or Preview change must add a row to `Version Register`.
- Do not mark `Completed` as `Yes` unless the user explicitly confirms the MVP definition workflow is finished.
- Figma Prompt versions remain in `docs/mvp/figma-prompts/`; this document records only the MVP-level version and completion state.
